			"notes": "The first official full release of Extra Enchants, for Minecraft version 0.1.0.\n\nThis mod uses the [reach entity attributes](https://github.com/JamiesWhiteShirt/reach-entity-attributes) library for enchantments that change user interaction range, and [Fabric ASM](https://github.com/Chocohead/Fabric-ASM) to add enchantment targets to the default enchantment target enumerator.\n\nThe attached datapack contains all of the default configurations for the mod."
